    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I find math challenging but not intimidating. As an upper secondary student with a passion for computer science and art, I appreciate its logic but struggle with abstract concepts. I often use baking analogies to make it relatable—like how ratios in recipes mirror equations. It’s a mix of curiosity and frustration.",
