    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I used AI tools like ChatGPT to check my work on algebra problems. It was helpful for clarifying steps but sometimes gave unclear explanations. I’d prefer more visual aids, like diagrams, to understand concepts better. Overall, it’s a good supplement but not a replacement for practice.",
